From 39b3761a3a630c4434a1226d652c4950e751252f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lukin <mylukin@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 5 Apr 2026 19:02:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 04/10] feat(cli-runner): 3-layer context overflow protection,
 session persistence, and process management

- Add 3-layer context overflow protection with /compact recovery
- Harden stale claude-cli resume failures
- Force stop active claude-cli runs on abort
- Stop cli fallback after manual cancel
- Suppress noisy abort reply failures
- Persist Claude prompt binding metadata and keep verified state on resume
- Improve backend routing and session rotation memory
- Stream-json mode integration for CLI runner

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
